@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010

### the old /api path still works, but announces its sunset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee

### the new /v1 path has no deprecation headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee

### /api and /v1 are the same handler, not a fork
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=1&fields=id,name

### an unversioned future path does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/tenants/ten_acme/products
